2026-04-20T18:14:45.917Z - User: bGtB7K2rFUI6abPrZhZ8 - Type: SUCCESS_RESPONSE - Project: 14-default-15 - FileId: 14J9215 - Data: {"action":"language_addition","request":{"inputJson":{"14J9215c1_c":"Gel polish application","14J9215c2_c":"Gel extension","14J9215c3_c":"Removal","14J9215i1_i":"Hand & feet","14J9215i1_d":"This service involves the application of gel polish to both hands and feet. It provides a durable finish for nails, suitable for those seeking a lasting color application. The process includes standard preparation for gel polish, aiming to enhance the appearance and longevity of the nail color.","14J9215i2_i":"Nail paint (regular)","14J9215i2_d":"This service offers the application of regular nail paint. It provides a classic color finish for nails, suitable for those desiring a traditional polish application. The process includes standard nail preparation before application, ensuring a smooth and even coat for a conventional manicure or pedicure.","14J9215i4_i":"Refilling","14J9215i4_d":"This service involves refilling existing gel nail extensions. It is performed to maintain the integrity and appearance of previously applied extensions as natural nails grow. The process typically includes filing and applying new gel material to the regrowth area, ensuring a seamless and continued look.","14J9215i3_i":"Nails extension","14J9215i3_d":"This service provides the application of gel nail extensions. It is designed to add length and strength to natural nails, creating a desired shape and appearance. The process involves extending the nail using gel material, offering a customizable and durable solution for nail enhancement.","14J9215i5_i":"Overlays","14J9215i5_d":"This service offers the application of gel overlays to natural nails. It provides an additional layer of gel for strength and protection without adding significant length. The process enhances the natural nail's durability and appearance, offering a supportive layer for weaker nails.","14J9215i6_i":"Tipo repair (per tip)","14J9215i6_d":"This service provides repair for a single nail tip. It addresses damage or breakage on individual gel extension tips, aiming to restore the nail's original shape and integrity. The process involves specific repair techniques for the affected tip, ensuring a consistent and complete set of nails.","14J9215i7_i":"Art (per tip)","14J9215i7_d":"This service offers the application of nail art on a single nail tip. It provides an aesthetic enhancement to gel extensions, allowing for customized designs. The process involves detailed artistic application on one tip, catering to individual preferences for decorative nail finishes.","14J9215i8_i":"Gel polish removal","14J9215i8_d":"This service provides professional removal of gel polish. It is performed to safely and effectively take off existing gel polish without causing damage to the natural nail. The process involves specific techniques for gel polish dissolution, preparing the nails for subsequent treatments or a natural state.","14J9215i9_i":"Gel extension / acrylic removal","14J9215i9_d":"This service offers the professional removal of gel or acrylic nail extensions. It is performed to safely and effectively take off existing extensions while minimizing potential damage to the natural nails. The process involves specific techniques for extension dissolution or reduction, ensuring nail health."},"targetLang":"zh","sourceLang":"en"},"response":{"translations":{"14J9215c1_c":"凝胶指甲油涂抹","14J9215c2_c":"凝胶延长","14J9215c3_c":"卸除","14J9215i1_i":"手部和足部","14J9215i1_d":"此服务包括在手部和足部涂抹凝胶指甲油。它为指甲提供持久的饰面，适合寻求持久色彩涂抹的人士。此过程包括凝胶指甲油的标准准备工作，旨在增强指甲颜色的外观和持久性。","14J9215i2_i":"指甲油 (普通)","14J9215i2_d":"此服务提供普通指甲油的涂抹。它为指甲提供经典的色彩饰面，适合那些希望进行传统指甲油涂抹的人士。此过程包括涂抹前的标准指甲准备工作，确保传统美甲或足疗的光滑均匀涂层。","14J9215i4_i":"补胶","14J9215i4_d":"此服务涉及对现有凝胶指甲延长进行补胶。它旨在随着自然指甲的生长，保持先前涂抹的延长的完整性和外观。此过程通常包括锉磨并在再生区域涂抹新的凝胶材料，确保无缝和持续的外观。","14J9215i3_i":"指甲延长","14J9215i3_d":"此服务提供凝胶指甲延长的涂抹。它旨在增加自然指甲的长度和强度，创造所需的形状和外观。此过程涉及使用凝胶材料延长指甲，为指甲增强提供可定制和耐用的解决方案。","14J9215i5_i":"覆盖","14J9215i5_d":"此服务提供在自然指甲上涂抹凝胶覆盖。它提供额外的凝胶层以增加强度和保护，而不会显著增加长度。此过程增强了自然指甲的耐用性和外观，为较弱的指甲提供支撑层。","14J9215i6_i":"甲尖修复 (每片)","14J9215i6_d":"此服务提供单个甲尖的修复。它处理单个凝胶延长甲尖的损坏或断裂，旨在恢复指甲的原始形状和完整性。此过程涉及针对受影响甲尖的特定修复技术，确保一套指甲的一致性和完整性。","14J9215i7_i":"美甲艺术 (每片)","14J9215i7_d":"此服务提供在单个甲尖上应用美甲艺术。它为凝胶延长提供美学增强，允许定制设计。此过程涉及在一个甲尖上进行详细的艺术应用，满足个人对装饰性指甲饰面的偏好。","14J9215i8_i":"凝胶指甲油卸除","14J9215i8_d":"此服务提供专业的凝胶指甲油卸除。它旨在安全有效地卸除现有凝胶指甲油，而不会对自然指甲造成损害。此过程涉及凝胶指甲油溶解的特定技术，为后续处理或自然状态准备指甲。","14J9215i9_i":"凝胶延长/水晶甲卸除","14J9215i9_d":"此服务提供凝胶或水晶甲延长的专业卸除。它旨在安全有效地卸除现有延长，同时最大程度地减少对自然指甲的潜在损害。此过程涉及延长溶解或减少的特定技术，确保指甲健康。"}},"transaction":{"transactionId":"ZJmBOuIOUTgQHE0FKTls","inputJson":{"14J9215c1_c":"Gel polish application","14J9215c2_c":"Gel extension","14J9215c3_c":"Removal","14J9215i1_i":"Hand & feet","14J9215i1_d":"This service involves the application of gel polish to both hands and feet. It provides a durable finish for nails, suitable for those seeking a lasting color application. The process includes standard preparation for gel polish, aiming to enhance the appearance and longevity of the nail color.","14J9215i2_i":"Nail paint (regular)","14J9215i2_d":"This service offers the application of regular nail paint. It provides a classic color finish for nails, suitable for those desiring a traditional polish application. The process includes standard nail preparation before application, ensuring a smooth and even coat for a conventional manicure or pedicure.","14J9215i4_i":"Refilling","14J9215i4_d":"This service involves refilling existing gel nail extensions. It is performed to maintain the integrity and appearance of previously applied extensions as natural nails grow. The process typically includes filing and applying new gel material to the regrowth area, ensuring a seamless and continued look.","14J9215i3_i":"Nails extension","14J9215i3_d":"This service provides the application of gel nail extensions. It is designed to add length and strength to natural nails, creating a d